Title:  A jailbird breaking rocks

Seq:    5.7.12.1.1

Level:  6 - Subdetail

Class:  quote

Attribution: [[Fontana, D. J.|D. J. Fontana]], as quoted in *[[Quoted in The Big Beat: Conversations with Rock's Greatest Drummers|The Big Beat: Conversations with Rock's Greatest Drummers]]*

Body:

The choreographer said, “We need a musical thing to go with the dancing.” They wanted to be able to visualize a jailbird breaking rocks. I came up with those \[opening snare drum\] shots. Me and Scotty started playing it and it worked.

